I'm Bilikis, a Business Administration graduate (HND, Ronik Polytechnic) making the move into business intelligence.

My final-year project looked at how the way an owner-manager leads affects the performance of food businesses in Lagos. Working on it showed me how much a well-asked question and a clear table can say about a business. That is the part of the work I want to do every day.

I'm learning in public. Each article on this site is something I've just worked through, written the way I wish someone had explained it to me.

## What I'm working on

- **Excel:** cleaning data, formulas and pivot tables
- **SQL:** next on the list
- **Power BI:** the goal, turning data into dashboards someone can make a decision from

If you're hiring for a junior data or BI role, or you're on the same path and want to compare notes, I'd love to hear from you.
